<mjml>
  <mj-head>
    <mj-attributes>
      <mj-all padding="0" />
      <mj-text font-family="sans-serif" />
      <mj-class name="header" padding="10px 10px 20px 10px" background-color="white" />
      <mj-class name="header-title" align="left" font-family="monospace" font-size="24pt" font-weight="600" line-height="24pt" padding-bottom="10px" />
      <mj-class name="header-image" align="right" width="100px" />
      <mj-class name="header-issue" align="left" font-family="monospace" font-weight="200" />
      <mj-class name="header-date" align="right" font-family="monospace" font-weight="200" />

      <mj-class name="article" padding-bottom="10px" />
      <mj-class name="article-title" font-family="monospace" font-weight="400" font-size="14pt" />

      <mj-class name="summary" padding="0 10px 20px 10px" />

      <mj-class name="category-heading" font-family="monospace" font-weight="600" font-size="18pt" />

      <mj-class name="articles" padding="0 10px 0 10px" />
      <mj-class name="images" padding="0 10px 20px 10px" />

      <mj-class name="footer" padding="10px 10px 10px 10px" />

      <mj-class name="footer-unsub" align="left" />
      <mj-class name="footer-feedback" align="right" />
    </mj-attributes>
  </mj-head>
  <mj-body>
    <mj-container>

      <!-- Header -->
      <mj-wrapper mj-class="header">
        <mj-section>
          <mj-column width="100%" vertical-align="middle">
            <mj-text mj-class="header-title">Newsletter del Lunes.</mj-text>
          </mj-column>
        </mj-section>

        <mj-section>
          <mj-group>
            <mj-column width="50%">
              <mj-text mj-class="header-issue">Issue No. 50</mj-text>
            </mj-column>
            <mj-column width="50%">
              <mj-text mj-class="header-date">23 Marzo 2026</mj-text>
            </mj-column>
          </mj-group>
        </mj-section>

        <mj-section>
          <mj-column>
            <mj-divider border-width="1px" border-style="dotted" border-color="lightgrey" />
          </mj-column>
        </mj-section>
      </mj-wrapper>
      <!-- /Header -->

      <!-- Summary -->
      <mj-section mj-class="summary">
        <mj-column>
          <mj-text>
            
Buenas a todos,
</br></br>
Aqui os paso el material de esta edición. Creo que lo mas accionable y entretenido es el tutorial sobre Copilot CLI, que espero que en algún momento de mi vida me ponga también a verlo.
</br></br>
Muchas gracias por estar ahí y un saludo!

          </mj-text>
        </mj-column>
      </mj-section>

      <!-- Images -->
      <mj-section mj-class="images">
        <mj-column>
          
        </mj-column>
      </mj-section>
      
      <mj-section>
        <mj-column>
          <mj-text>
            <h2>Artículos</h2>
          </mj-text>
        </mj-column>
      </mj-section>

      <!-- Articles -->
			<mj-wrapper mj-class="articles">
				
          
					<mj-section mj-class="article">
						<mj-column>
							
              <mj-text mj-class="article-title"><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=FXwBWS4qDAA">Stop Mixing FastAPI with Business Logic: Fix It with Ports & Adapters - YouTube [video] </a></mj-text>
              
							<mj-text mj-class="article-summary">Como aplicar de forma práctica arquitectura Hexagonal. Este tipo de arquitectura me parece muy interesante por varios motivos. Solamente entra la parte abstracta del negocio, cumple Clean Code y además permite el teteo de forma sencilla.</mj-text>
						</mj-column>
					</mj-section>
				  
        
          
					<mj-section mj-class="article">
						<mj-column>
							
              <mj-text mj-class="article-title"><a href="https://app.supermo.no/share/250402945e6fd263/594c54df8c">La Bonilista — Qué carallo son los Forward Deployed Engineers...</a></mj-text>
              
							<mj-text mj-class="article-summary">Artículo de la bolinista hablando sobre los Forward Deployed Engineers. La verdad es que suena a Outsourcing pero no os confundáis que el concepto es distinto.</mj-text>
						</mj-column>
					</mj-section>
				  
        
          
					<mj-section mj-class="article">
						<mj-column>
							
              <mj-text mj-class="article-title"><a href="https://github.com/github/copilot-cli-for-beginners">GitHub - github/copilot-cli-for-beginners: Learn how to get started using the GitHub Copilot CLI! · GitHub</a></mj-text>
              
							<mj-text mj-class="article-summary">Pequeño curso para empezar a utilizar Copilot CLI. Recuerdo que la empresa ofrece la herramienta, si alguien no la tiene que me lo comente. Si alguien no lo está usando ni piensa usarla que también lo comente.</mj-text>
						</mj-column>
					</mj-section>
				  
        
          
					<mj-section mj-class="article">
						<mj-column>
							
              <mj-text mj-class="article-title"><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=5oh4uQvaA00&list=PLXOzhXs9brxe0u-OjHjtOjHJYRaP3W2Vh&index=10">Anastasiia Zvenigorodskaia. How to make Open Source Profitable. #OpenSouthCode25 - YouTube [video] </a></mj-text>
              
							<mj-text mj-class="article-summary">Ya tenemos algunos de los vídeos de la pasada OpenSouthCode. Este en concreto habla de las diferentes maneras de monetizar un proyecto OpenSource (¿podría ser el tuyo?).</mj-text>
						</mj-column>
					</mj-section>
				  
        

        
      </mj-wrapper>

      <!-- Footer -->
      <mj-wrapper mj-class="footer">
        <mj-section>
          <mj-column>
            <mj-divider border-width="1px" border-style="dotted" border-color="lightgrey" padding-bottom="5px" />
          </mj-column>
        </mj-section>

        <mj-section>
          <mj-group>
            <mj-column width="50%">
              <mj-text mj-class="footer-unsub">Not interested? <a href="mailto:daniel.agredano@gtd.eu?Subject=iX%20Newsletter%20--%20Unsubscribe">Unsubscribe</a></mj-text>
            </mj-column>
            <mj-column width="50%">
              <mj-text mj-class="footer-feedback"><a href="mailto:daniel.agredano@gtd.eu?Subject=iX%20Newsletter%20--%20Feedback">Feedback</a></mj-text>
            </mj-column>
          </mj-group>
        </mj-section>
      </mj-wrapper>

    </mj-container>
  </mj-body>
</mjml>
